                          COUNTDOWN TO EXTINCTION
                      By Dave Mustaine, Dave Ellefson, 
                       Nick Menza and Marty Friedman
 
 This is a real good and easy song, hope you enjoy it

Notation Legend.-                       
       % = repeat last bar
       / = slide up
       \ = slide down
       . = palm mute 
       p = pull off
       h = hammer on
       /\/\/\ = vibrato (it's up to you if you want to use the bar or not)
       b«   = bend half step or equivalent
       pb«  = pre-bend 
       br«  = bend and release
       pbr« = pre-bend and release

  Normal tunning 
     Moderately Rock = 126
